Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Compute balance growth on fiscal year ends only

asset_growth and equity_growth compared any balance with the prior
fiscal year's balance, so a 31 March balance against the previous year
end was stored as annual growth while measuring three months: 397 such
rows in the current imports. Balance growth now needs a fiscal year end
(a date some FY flow ends on) and the exact prior year end, the day
before that fiscal year starts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
