A key closed on both sides but exported without values on one side was
reported as a period mismatch; it is now listed as not comparable.
Periods one pipeline holds and the other does not are reported apart
from value conflicts, flagged with any engine correction that touched
the key, and limited to the common date range when an export truncated
its observations, which exports now mark.

